<body data-time="all">
  <header class="site"><div class="wrap bar">
    <a class="brand" href="/">Vault <b>Human</b></a>
    <nav class="navlinks"><a href="#how">How it works</a><a href="#pricing">Pricing</a><a href="/writing">Writing</a><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Start — $97/mo</a></nav>
  </div></header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="timeword"><span class="tw past">Past</span><span class="tw present">Present</span><span class="tw future">Future</span></div>
        <h1>A coach. Every day. <em>For $97 a month.</em></h1>
        <p class="lede">Vault Human is daily coaching. Each morning you get one short lesson and one small thing to do. A real person reads what you write back. Over a year, your life gets in order.</p>
        <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Start — $97/mo</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="#how">How it works</a></div>
        <p class="welcome">Vault Human · <b>Listen</b> · the whole picture</p>
      </div>
      <div class="proof"><div class="wrap proof-grid"><div><b>1</b><span>Short lesson a day</span></div><div><b>1</b><span>Real coach, not a bot</span></div><div><b>12</b><span>Months</span></div><div><b>$97</b><span>A month. Cancel any time</span></div></div></div>
    </section>

    <section class="sec" id="why"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Why most self-help fails</p><h2>You don't need more books.<br>You need a plan and a person.</h2></div>
      <div class="pains"><div class="pain"><h3>No plan</h3><p>Good ideas, in no order. So none of them stick.</p></div><div class="pain"><h3>No person</h3><p>Apps count your streak. Nobody reads what you wrote.</p></div><div class="pain"><h3>No whole picture</h3><p>Your money, your health, your family: all handled by people who never talk to each other.</p></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec dark" id="russ"><div class="wrap guide-grid">
      <img src="/russ-michaels.jpg" alt="Russ Michaels" width="340" height="425" loading="lazy" />
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Your coach</p><h2>Russ Michaels</h2><p class="lede">Twenty years leading organizations. An attorney, still practicing. He walks the keys on the same schedule you do.</p><blockquote>Sometimes we meet life where it is, not where we are. We hold that together.</blockquote><div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://www.vaulthuman.com/writing">Writing</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/russ-michaels/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec alt" id="how"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">How it works</p><h2>Three steps.</h2></div>
      <div class="steps"><div class="step"><div class="n">01</div><h3>Sign up</h3><p>$97 a month. A real person replies within the minute, with your first lesson.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">02</div><h3>Talk to Russ</h3><p>A 30-minute call within two days. No sales pitch.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">03</div><h3>Walk the year</h3><p>One lesson a day. Write three lines at night. We read them.</p></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec" id="pricing"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Pricing</p><h2>A year, not a weekend.</h2></div>
      <div class="offers"><div class="offer feat"><div class="tag">Start here</div><h3>The Keys</h3><div class="price">$97<small>/mo</small></div><p>One short lesson every morning. We read your notes. A group call each month.</p><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Start</a></div><div class="offer"><div class="tag">With a coach</div><h3>The Coached Year</h3><div class="price">Apply</div><p>Everything above, plus a private session with Russ every week and a small group of six.</p><a class="btn btn-line" href="#" data-open-form>Apply</a></div><div class="offer"><div class="tag">For families</div><h3>The Family Year</h3><div class="price">Apply</div><p>The Coached Year for your household, two to four people, together.</p><a class="btn btn-line" href="#" data-open-form>Ask</a></div></div>
      <p class="offers-note">Have a team? Executive &amp; Team coaching is on the call too. You are never charged for the past, the present or the future. You pay for coaching.</p>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec dark" id="family"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Learn · Love · Live</p><h2>Who does the work?</h2><p class="lede">Three companies, one owner, one method. Vault Human is the coaching. These are the people behind it.</p></div>
      <div class="tl-rail"></div>
      <div class="tl-cards"><a class="tlc brown" href="https://www.fretworksystems.com" target=_blank rel=noopener><div class="when">Learn · The past</div><h3>Fretwork</h3><p>Fixes how your work runs: tools, workflows, AI. Not a coach. Not a law firm.</p><span>fretworksystems.com ↗</span></a><a class="tlc green" href="https://triplicityadvisory.com" target=_blank rel=noopener><div class="when">Love · The present</div><h3>Triplicity</h3><p>The coaching company. Runs every Vault Human coaching program.</p><span>triplicityadvisory.com ↗</span></a><a class="tlc navy" href="https://www.tercetlaw.com" target=_blank rel=noopener><div class="when">Live · The future</div><h3>Tercet</h3><p>The law firm. Wills, trusts, and a plan for your family. Not coaching.</p><span>tercetlaw.com ↗</span></a></div>
      <p class="constant">The Constant: <a href="https://www.vaulthuman.com">Vault Human</a> — Listen.</p>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec alt" id="faq"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Questions</p><h2>Straight answers.</h2></div>
      <div class="faq"><details><summary>What is Vault Human, in one sentence?</summary><p>Daily coaching: a short lesson every morning, one small action, and a real person who reads what you write.</p></details><details><summary>What are Fretwork, Triplicity and Tercet?</summary><p>The three companies behind the coaching. Fretwork fixes how work runs. Triplicity does the coaching. Tercet does wills and trusts. You never need to visit them to be coached.</p></details><details><summary>Is this therapy?</summary><p>No. It is coaching. If you need a therapist, we say so.</p></details><details><summary>How much time does it take?</summary><p>About ten minutes a day. The Coached Year adds an hour a week.</p></details><details><summary>Can I cancel?</summary><p>Yes. Any time, no fee.</p></details></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec final" id="begin"><div class="wrap">
      <h2>Start tomorrow morning.</h2><p class="lede">Sign up tonight. Your first lesson is in your inbox at 7 a.m.</p>
      <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Start — $97/mo</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="tel:+18888332510">(888) 833-2510</a></div>
    </div></section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site">
    <div class="wrap foot">
      <div><a class="brand" href="/">Vault <b>Human</b></a><p>Daily coaching. $97 a month.</p><p><a href="mailto:vault@vaulthuman.com">vault@vaulthuman.com</a> · <a href="tel:+18888332510">(888) 833-2510</a></p></div>
      <ul><li><a href="#how">How it works</a></li><li><a href="#pricing">Pricing</a></li><li><a href="/writing">Writing</a></li><li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/russ-michaels/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a></li></ul>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.vaulthuman.com">Vault Human</a> — Listen</li><li><a href="https://www.fretworksystems.com">Fretwork</a> — Learn · the past</li><li><a href="https://triplicityadvisory.com">Triplicity</a> — Love · the present</li><li><a href="https://www.tercetlaw.com">Tercet Law</a> — Live · the future</li></ul>
    </div>
    <div class="wrap legal"><span>&copy; {year} Vault Human, LLC. Coaching is not legal, medical, financial or therapeutic advice.</span><span>Part of the Vault Human family</span></div>
  </footer>

  <div id="vh-modal" class="vh-modal" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="vh-modal__bg" data-close-form></div>
    <div class="vh-modal__card" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="Start with the Keys">
      <button class="vh-modal__x" type="button" data-close-form aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
      <h2 class="vh-modal__title">Start with the Keys</h2><p class="vh-modal__sub">A person replies within the minute. The first key comes with it.</p>
      <div class="hs-form-frame" data-region="na2" data-form-id="3f225ab5-5a70-46d9-a497-29e6256b1e52" data-portal-id="246947446"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <script is:inline src="https://js-na2.hsforms.net/forms/embed/246947446.js" defer></script>
  <script is:inline>
  (function(){var m=document.getElementById('vh-modal');if(!m)return;
  function o(e){if(e)e.preventDefault();m.classList.add('is-open');m.setAttribute('aria-hidden','false');document.documentElement.style.overflow='hidden';}
  function c(){m.classList.remove('is-open');m.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');document.documentElement.style.overflow='';}
  document.addEventListener('click',function(e){var t=e.target.closest('[data-open-form]');if(t){o(e);return;}if(e.target.closest('[data-close-form]'))c();});
  document.addEventListener('keydown',function(e){if(e.key==='Escape')c();});
  if(location.hash==='#start')o();})();
  addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',function(){
   document.body.classList.add('ready');
   if(!('IntersectionObserver'in window))return;
   var e=[].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('.sec .wrap > *'));e.forEach(function(x){x.classList.add('reveal')});
   var o=new IntersectionObserver(function(t){t.forEach(function(y){if(y.isIntersecting){y.target.classList.add('in');o.unobserve(y.target)}})},{threshold:0.08,rootMargin:'0px 0px -30px 0px'});
   e.forEach(function(x){o.observe(x)});
  });
  </script>
</body>
